// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Brother_Hammond 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Brother Hammond 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2752655097" "Brother Hammond"
// ProfessionString :
"P4015777149" "Luddite Preacher"
// DescriptionString :
"P1016411065" "Brother Hammond was one of Martin Henri's first converts, and has been a devoted follower ever since. While many of his brothers take up arms against those who would use technology - which his order proclaims is as sinful as making bargains with devils - he chooses instead to evangelize on the streets of Aeon City. He believes that, if he can spread the word of Truth to enough people, his brotherhood will grow to become a sizable force in Cap au Diable. So far, those efforts have proved fruitless."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3285136270" "Good day, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P1650745072" "Greetings, {Hero.gender=male Brother|Sister} {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1562801827" "Hail, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister}. Have you come to hear the truth?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4292234272" "Begone, foul one. Your forked tongue will not sway me again."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1878771027" "I have words of wisdom for you, {Hero.gender=male brother|sister}, but you seem overburdened. Leave your earthly desires behind, and then we may talk."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4098618558" "You really shouldn't be here, my friend. It is a dangerous place for the meek."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2769111254" "I am speaking this line to you because something broke. It's probably Dr. Aeon's fault, but you should write a bug about it anyway."
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FirstVisitTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2155040430" "<color orange>A dirty-looking man in a hood is waving his hands around, shouting at the top of his lungs.</color><br><br>Hear me, people! You may drink in the excesses that Aeon provides you now, but if you do not act soon, your souls will be forfeit! Aeon has made a terrible bargain, and all of the Rogue Isles will suffer for his hubris!<br><br>Come to me now, and let me tell you of the Chosen One! Soon, {Hero.gender=male he|she} will rise from the ranks of the fallen, and will strike at Aeon and his minions!"
// Answer Text :
"P1900320888" "Interesting... I'd like to hear more."
// Answer Text :
"P2803422187" "Don't you people ever shut up?"
// Page ShutUp Text :
"P2813289558" "<color orange>The man glares at you with contempt.</color><br><br>I shall suffer your insults with dignity, dog of Aeon, for I know that I speak the Truth. The words of the great Martin Henri spread wisdom to the masses. If you cannot bear to hear the words of Truth, so be it. The price of ignorance will be yours to pay.<br><br><color orange>The man points a dirty finger at you.</color><br><br>But if you stay, and hear my words... you will see their wisdom. Not even the greatest of fools can remain ignorant after hearing the Truth."
// Answer Text :
"P1241144961" "Oh, this should be good. Go ahead and tell me your 'truth'."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


