// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Marshal_Brass 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Marshal Brass 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P710683197" "Marshal Brass"
// ProfessionString :
"P3303037832" "Arachnos Marshal of Cap Au Diable"
// DescriptionString :
"P120011012" "Marshal Leon Brass is the head of all Arachnos military operations in Cap Au Diable. Though he technically reports to Dr. Aeon, the Island's governor, Marshal Brass has a lot of power on his own. Many think that he was put in place to Monitor Dr. Aeon for Arachnos, and remove him by force should the erratic scientist become a threat."
// HelloString :
"P4066645975" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Greetings.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P242323640" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>It's on.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1907109213" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ready?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P316349629" "I have no idea who you are, but I'm open minded. If you come to me with the recommendation of Dr. Shelly Percey, we'll be able to work together."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1473594645" "Get this straight: As Marshal, I shouldn't be talking to you. But I need to have some things done. And I think you can do them."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P889303782" "I don't have anything more for you. Deal with it."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1701985478" "I am the Marshal and commander of all Arachnos forces in Cap Au Diable. Do not even come to me unless you can give me your undivided attention. Finish the other jobs you have first. Then we can talk."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P413109885" "I have something, but it's classified beyond you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2786426316" "You do good work. You should see if one of my new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> can help sharpen your edge. You may contact me directly, if you wish."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4053547279" "You've proven yourself. My <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store</A> is entirely open to you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P277970663" "I'm an important person, but there are many others above me. I think you'll do fine in the future."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1984567526" "Marshal Brass is the head of all Arachnos forces for Cap Au Diable. He works directly under Dr. Aeon, and rumor has it, isn't too happy about that fact. He might have some work for a freelancer like you. He can get you all the Technology and Natural Enhancements you need."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2013880249" "Choose Marshal Brass"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4089575207" "The Marshal is taciturn and gruff, and not known for much of a sense of humor. Considering that he has to spend most of his time cleaning up Dr. Aeon's messes, it's a wonder he's even that personable."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3523465947" "I have <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> to refer you to."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3105876127" "I know some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> you should speak to."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


