// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Virgil_Tarikoss 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 28 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Virgil Tarikoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4047320273" "Virgil Tarikoss"
// ProfessionString :
"P708718508" "Cagey Mystic"
// DescriptionString :
"P2540106306" "Virgil Tarikoss is a newcomer to the Rogue Isles, but has already made a name for himself by playing other mystics off against each other as he works towards his own secretive goals. He has recently made it known that he might be looking for a partner to help him complete his master plan. Though no one knows what Tarikoss' final objective is, all those in the know agree that it will be something big."
// HelloString :
"P1112878414" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>It's about time, {VillainName}. Are your ready?</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3668894932" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is still much to do, {VillainName}. Still so very much to do.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2319619131" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Are you ready? Are you unafraid?</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1799350800" "I have no knowledge of you and no need of you. Begone."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3383194970" "If you have sought me, out then you must be ambitious. If you have found what is needed to speak to me, you must be wicked. These aspects combined make you perfect for the tasks I can place before you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P181836775" "We are done. The balance of the cosmos is still maintained, and all that is left between us is my regret is that you were not bound eternally along with Bat'Zul, and no doubt your sincere but impractical desire to do me harm. On this stalemate, we part ways forever."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4083880885" "I need your total concentration, {VillainName}. Complete the other wicked things you are doing and return."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2194232478" "You do not yet have the power I need of you. Begone until you are ready."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P929222623" "You are new to this world and have done little to learn its ways. Roam these isles; learn their secrets. Collect at least ten badges that prove the sort of person you are. Then, we will speak."
// BadgeFirstTick :
"P3329959131" "You have already begun to prove the kind of person you are. Collect more badges, and we may talk."
// BadgeSecondTick :
"P3714530235" "You are doing well; however, I am still unsure of your character. You must collect more badges."
// BadgeThirdTick :
"P355880757" "I am nearly convinced you are ideal for my purposes. Once you have ten badges, we can begin."
// BadgeFourthTick :
"P2472066934" "Ten badges, no fewer! Only then will I know what you're made of."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3346764017" "You have proven to me that you may be capable, {VillainName}. Capable indeed. You should check in with me regularly. Perhaps you need <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements?</A> I will aid you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3966113081" "You have proven very useful to me, {VillainName}. Perhaps I can be useful to you as well. Please, peruse my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P470582155" "Your abilities would be wasted on me. Go. Be about wickedness commensurate to your power."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1283946247" "Virgil Tarikoss contacted me because he knew I was working with you. That could be very good for you. Tarikoss is a new player among all the mystics of the Rogue Isles. No one knows a thing about him, except that he knows things no one else does; that he has a plan; and that he needs someone capable to help him complete it. He thinks you're capable enough. Rumors say he can get his hands on Natural and Magic Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3308232628" "Speak with Tarikoss"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2942990960" "Tarikoss may be onto something big, but something tells me he's onto even more than he's letting on."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1235127284" "You probably shouldn't see this dialogue. Strange, isn't it?"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3965272387" "This is my 'introduce two contacts' dialogue. You probably shouldn't be seeing this. Very strange."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


