// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Willy_Wheeler 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Willy Wheeler 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1118228063" "Willy Wheeler"
// ProfessionString :
"P1806910968" "Street Fixer"
// DescriptionString :
"P352065527" "Everyone has heard about Willy 'Dealer' Wheeler. He's the guy who wants to hit it big, but hasn't - he's a little man with a big chip on his shoulder.<br><br>Lately, however, things have been different. Apparently Willy's got a new source with hot tips. Who knows? Maybe Willy has finally hit the big time. "
// HelloString :
"P928465342" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Heya! Got something hot for ya!</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2539233111" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ready to wheel and deal with the wheel-man?</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3246464868" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hey there, {VillainName}! Got some stuff for ya!</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P109590833" "You heard of me? Well I ain't heard of you! Get lost! I don't deal with no one who doesn't come from Peter Themari!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P2535719825" "Y-you heard of me? I mean... of course you have! Willy 'Dealer' Wheeler - that's me! You want to hit the big time, I can get you there! You need something dealt with, just call The Dealer! That's what's they say! No, really!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3450287551" "I got nothin' for ya! Y'hear me? Nothin'!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1845986453" "You seem real busy already, {VillainName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4013221478" "I have something, but you're not tough enough to Deal with the Wheel. Come talk to me when you're Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3116421549" "You're okay by me, {VillainName}! Here! Take my number! You need some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements,</A> buddy? I got 'em!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2487483875" "You and me, we're gonna hit the big time! Y'hear me? The big time! You need any <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements,</A> I'm your guy!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1207099789" "Looks like you're leavin' Willy behind. Put in a good word for me, huh?"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2161879158" "This may be scraping the bottom of the barrel, but I know this guy named Willy 'Dealer' Wheeler. He likes to think of himself as a big time player, but he's really small time. Still, he's been getting some big leads as of late, and might be worth checking in to. Tell you the truth, I'd like to see the two of you working together. It might prove entertaining. Willy may be a joke, but at least he can get his hands on Mutant and Magic Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P672293508" "Choose Willy 'Dealer' Wheeler"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2397866186" "If you can tolerate him, he might provide you with some good leads."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4254739923" "I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> who might be able to help you out."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3602023423" "Here's a long shot, but I know some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> who might give you some leads."
